    {
      "_id": "KDUeQyj1J71Vb3Q1",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "Absorb Wraith",
      "sort": 900000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The dread wraith extends its hand toward another wraith creature within 100 feet. The target wraith dissolves and streaks toward the dread wraith in a straight line, dealing [[/r 6d10[negative]]] damage to each creature along the line (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:28|basic:true] save).</p>\n<p>The dread wraith absorbs the essence of the target wraith, becoming @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} and gaining a +10-foot status bonus to its fly Speed for a number of rounds equal to the level of the absorbed wraith. It can use its extra action only to Fly or Strike.</p>\n<p>An unwilling target can attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:28|traits:damaging-effect] save to resist being absorbed.</p>"
        },
        "source": {
