      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A living humanoid slain by a wraith's spectral hand Strike rises as a wraith spawn after [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. This wraith spawn is under the command of the dread wraith that killed it. It doesn't have drain life or wraith spawn. If the creator of the wraith spawn dies, the wraith spawn becomes a full-fledged, autonomous wraith; it regains its free will and gains drain life and wraith spawn.</p>"
